Patched crates: hayro-interpret, hayro-syntax, kurbo, usvg, svgtypes, resvg,
tiny-skia, tiny-skia-path

Folio builds modified copies of these crates.io releases in place of the
releases (SPEC §2.4, D-300-1): their floating-point code calls the `libm`
crate where it called the platform's maths library. Each copy keeps its
licence files, carries a `FOLIO.md` that names the release and states what
Folio changed, and marks every changed file with a comment that starts with
"Folio:"; the whole change is in third_party/patches/. third_party/README.md
describes them.

